Required attribution
--------------------

Credit both the individual setter(s) and the QPD problem-setting group:

    "Problem by <Setter>, QPD problem-setting group (SSBS '28)."

For problems with multiple setters, list all of them:

    "Problem by Alice Liu and Ryan Huang, QPD problem-setting group (SSBS '28)."

The setter names are recorded in each problem's `\meta{setter}` field.

